# nutng-{{.Kind}}-{{.Name}}

A nutng {{.Kind}} plugin, created by `nutng plugin new`.

```sh
go mod tidy
go build -o nutng-{{.Kind}}-{{.Name}}{{.Exe}}
```

Copy the executable to a plugin directory (`nutng plugin list` shows them),
then check it with `nutng plugin info {{.Name}}`.
{{if not .SDKPath}}
nut-ng is not published as a Go module yet. Until it is, add a replace
line to go.mod that points at a nut-ng checkout, or create the plugin with
`nutng plugin new --sdk /path/to/nut-ng`.
{{end}}
